  "description": "Ahn Da-jung, a fourth-year emergency medicine resident at MIGANG Hospital, was doing her job as a healthcare provider when she was slapped in the face.\n\n\"This is not a playground, Mr. Do,\" she says.  \n\"You saved my life, you should be responsible.\"\n\nThe best-looking, best-financed VIP, Mr. Do Tae-in, is the only problem.\n\n\"Please leave. Don't interrupt my treatment.\"  \n\"Hmm. My sweetheart pushed me away so coldly, it hurts.\"  \n\"I will call the psychiatry.\"\n\nThis guy is crazy! Tae-in, the perfect guy except for one thing, starts following Da-jung around for some reason...\n\n\"When are you going to get tired of me?\"  \n\"I don't think I'll ever get tired of you, Ms. Ahn Da-jung.\"\n\nWith her dream of becoming a wealthy, single mother, will she be able to fulfill that dream?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62811163), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9D%91%EA%B8%89-%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%91%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-%EC%B9%98%EB%A3%8C%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95/3762)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/157202)",
